# Atlas Pricing & Payment Structure

## Atlas Payment Summary

1. **Implementation, Customisation & Deployment:** R20,000 once-off
2. **Annual Atlas Licence & Support:** R30,000 per year, paid upfront
3. **Atlas Application Processing Charge:** R5 per qualifying application, billed annually in arrears
4. **Maximum Billable Application Volume:** 25,000 qualifying applications per annual licence period
5. **Maximum Annual Atlas Charge:** R155,000 per annual licence period
6. **Firebase / Google Cloud Infrastructure:** Paid directly by the college

---

## Implementation, Customisation & Deployment

| Date                | Payment / Event                                                              |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Initial go-live** | **R20,000** Implementation, Customisation & Deployment fee is paid once-off. |

This fee applies to the initial implementation, institution-specific configuration, customisation and production deployment of Atlas.

---

## Annual Licence & Application Processing Charges

| Date                        | Payment / Event                                                                                                                       |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **1 January**               | **R30,000** Annual Atlas Licence & Support fee for the new annual licence period is paid upfront.                                     |
| **1 January – 30 November** | The application cycle operates and qualifying applications accumulate for the annual application-processing period.                   |
| **30 November**             | The annual application-processing period closes.                                                                                      |
| **1 – 30 December**         | Atlas calculates the Application Processing Charge at **R5 per qualifying application** processed during the completed annual period. |
| **1 January – 30 November** | The new annual application-processing period operates and qualifying applications accumulate.                                         |
| **30 November**             | The new annual application-processing period closes.                                                                                  |
| **1 – 30 December**         | The Application Processing Charge for the completed period is calculated and invoiced.                                                |

### Annual Application Volume Limit

The Atlas Application Processing Charge applies to a maximum of **25,000 qualifying applications per annual licence period**.

Applications above 25,000 during the same annual period may continue to be processed through Atlas; however, **no additional Atlas Application Processing Charge will apply to applications above the 25,000-application threshold**.

Accordingly:

**25,000 applications × R5 = R125,000 maximum Application Processing Charges**

plus:

**R30,000 Annual Atlas Licence & Support**

= **R155,000 maximum recurring Atlas charge per annual licence period.**

